# Caddy in front of nuvira-server (TCP 21116): status page, WebSocket /nuvira,
# update files and, with NuviraHub Pro, web console, web client, invitations and
# REST API. Caddy gets the certificate from Let's Encrypt by itself and passes
# WebSocket upgrades and X-Forwarded-For with no extra setting.
# UDP 21116 does not go through here: forward it to the server directly.
#
# nuvira-server is the container's name on the same Docker network as Caddy;
# with Caddy on the host use localhost:21116.
nuvira.example.com {
	reverse_proxy nuvira-server:21116
}
